OL,3,GNEWSA'There is no typical foster carer
OL,4,A- do not rule yourself out'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt began as a simple inquiry.
OL,8,FBut more than 15 years later, fostering
OL,9,Fremains a central part of Dan's life.
OL,11,FNow he is the face of a Dorset Council
OL,12,Fcampaign urging people to set aside
OL,13,Ftheir misconceptions about fostering,
OL,14,Fas the authority says it urgently needs
OL,15,Fmore foster carers.
OL,17,FDan, from Weymouth, said there is no
OL,18,Fsuch thing as a typical foster carer,
OL,19,Fand encouraged anyone with an interest
OL,20,Fto find out more.
